        "type": "base",
        "_id": "Tc42bN2tPnsp2xIl",
        "description": "<p>Your companion transforms into a creature made of elemental energy. Choose a damage type from cold, fire, lightning, or sonic damage. While transformed, your companion gains the following benefits:</p><p>Your companion can [[/apply XK28yJ1ABG20gRs9 turn originDuration=true]]{fly}. If they could already fly, they gain a [[/apply wO64r7wrbxnQ4Zb4 turn originDuration=true]]{+2 bonus to speed}.</p><p>When your companion enters another creature's space for the first time on a turn or damages a creature with a strike, your companion deals [[/damage 5 type=cold/fire/lightning/sonic]]{5 damage of the chosen type}to the creature.</p><p>Your companion has [[/apply Iqf5IFw5NdsbCVth turn originDuration=true]]{immunity all} to the chosen damage type and [[/apply noqA2wbEoCOHHAQR originDuration=true turn]]{immunity 5} to all other damage.</p><p>Your companion's transformation lasts until the start of your next turn. At the start of each of your turns, you can spend [[/gain formula=-3 type=heroic]]{3 ferocity} to extend the transformation's duration for one turn. When you do so, you can change the chosen damage type.</p>",
        "before": false
      }
    }
  },
